---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Services — IslandTwig Studios"
	description="The Legacy to New Era System: a complete sports identity built from your organization's own story. Plus Legacy Mark and Elevate the Identity for teams that need a different starting point."
	path="/services"
>
	<div class="content">
		<header class="header">
			<div class="text-col">
				<p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
				<h1 class="a2">Every great team has a story. Every great community has traditions.</h1>
				<p class="a2">We create the identity that brings them together. Rather than designing logos in a vacuum, IslandTwig uncovers what makes an organization unique and transforms it into an identity people are proud to represent.</p>
				<div class="availability a3">Available for new projects</div>
			</div>
		</header>
	</div>

	<section class="services-band-light signature-band">
	<div class="content">

		<!-- SIGNATURE OFFER: LEGACY TO NEW ERA SYSTEM -->
		<div class="signature-grid">
			<div class="signature-text a5">
				<h2>Legacy to New Era System</h2>
				<p class="signature-tagline">From overlooked to unforgettable.</p>
				<p class="signature-desc">A complete sports identity system for organizations entering a new chapter. Whether you're launching a brand-new team or modernizing an established program, this service uncovers your organization's story and transforms it into an identity built to represent your community for years to come.</p>
				<div class="signature-actions">
					<a href="/legacy-session" class="btn-signature">Start a Legacy Session</a>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="signature-image a6">
				<img src="/images/services/tier-system.jpg" alt="Utah Yeti full brand system: primary and secondary marks, wordmark lockups, jerseys, number set, and color palette, an example of the Legacy to New Era System" />
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="signature-phases a7">
			<p class="eyebrow">The Process</p>
			<div class="process-grid">
				<div class="process-step">
					<span class="step-num">01</span>
					<h4>Discover the Legacy</h4>
					<p>Every project begins with the Legacy Session, uncovering your organization's history, community roots, culture, and traditions.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-step">
					<span class="step-num">02</span>
					<h4>Define the Identity</h4>
					<p>Research becomes strategy: core themes, symbolism, visual direction, and the design principles that guide every decision.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-step">
					<span class="step-num">03</span>
					<h4>Craft the System</h4>
					<p>Strategy becomes identity: primary logo, wordmark, color palette, typography, and a complete set of brand guidelines.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-step">
					<span class="step-num">04</span>
					<h4>Launch into a New Era</h4>
					<p>The identity is introduced to the world, with mockups, rollout guidance, and the story behind the mark.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>

	</div>
	</section>

	<section class="services-band-soft">
	<div class="content">

		<!-- OTHER WAYS TO WORK TOGETHER -->
		<p class="eyebrow a4">Other Ways to Work Together</p>
		<div class="tiers tiers-two">

			<div class="tier t-logo a5">
				<div class="tier-image">
					<img src="/images/services/tier-logo.jpg" alt="Utah Yeti primary logo mark, an example of a Legacy Mark project" />
				</div>
				<div class="tier-inner">
					<h3 class="tier-name">Legacy Mark</h3>
					<p class="tier-clarifier">Starting with the mark.</p>
					<!-- Pricing hidden for now, kept here to re-enable later.
					<div class="tier-price">$500</div>
					<div class="tier-timeline">1&ndash;2 weeks</div>
					-->
					<p class="tier-desc">For organizations that need a professionally crafted team mark without investing in a complete identity system. The same craftsmanship and thoughtful design that defines every IslandTwig project, at a smaller scale.</p>
					<div class="tier-includes">Ideal for</div>
					<ul>
						<li>New clubs</li>
						<li>Small organizations</li>
						<li>Budget-conscious teams</li>
						<li>Early-stage programs</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="tier t-system a6">
				<div class="tier-image">
					<img src="/images/services/tier-identity.jpg" alt="Utah Yeti brand identity applied across merchandise and gameday graphics, an example of Elevate the Identity work" />
				</div>
				<div class="tier-inner">
					<h3 class="tier-name">Elevate the Identity</h3>
					<p class="tier-clarifier">Bring your identity to life.</p>
					<p class="tier-desc">Once an identity is established, it can be expanded into every experience your organization creates. Every engagement is custom-scoped to fit your goals.</p>
					<div class="tier-includes">Examples</div>
					<ul>
						<li>Uniform &amp; merchandise systems</li>
						<li>Gameday &amp; social graphics</li>
						<li>Event &amp; environmental branding</li>
						<li>Ongoing creative direction</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>

		</div>

		<!-- CUSTOM TIER -->
		<a href="#start" class="custom-tier a7">
			<div class="custom-tier-inner">
				<div>
					<h3>Not sure what you need?</h3>
					<p>Tell me about your organization and I'll help you figure out the right starting point.</p>
				</div>
				<span class="arrow-link">
					Tell me about it
					<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
				</span>
			</div>
		</a>

	</div>
	</section>

	<section class="services-band-dark">
	<div class="content">

		<!-- PROCESS -->
		<section class="process-section a8">
			<h2 class="eyebrow">How it works</h2>
			<div class="process-grid">
				<div class="process-step">
					<span class="step-num">01</span>
					<h4>Inquiry</h4>
					<p>Send the form below or email me. I'll respond within a day with questions and a rough timeline.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-step">
					<span class="step-num">02</span>
					<h4>Kickoff</h4>
					<p>50% deposit, a short brief, and we start. You'll get a clear schedule for concepts and revisions.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-step">
					<span class="step-num">03</span>
					<h4>Concepts &amp; Revisions</h4>
					<p>Concepts arrive together. We refine the direction you like best through the included revision rounds.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="process-step">
					<span class="step-num">04</span>
					<h4>Delivery</h4>
					<p>Final 50% on delivery. You get all source files, exports, and any guide documents in one package.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

	</div>
	</section>

	<section class="services-band-light">
	<div class="content">

		<!-- INTAKE FORM -->
		<section class="intake-section a8" id="start">
			<h2>Ready to define your team's next chapter?</h2>
			<p class="lead">Tell me what you're working on. Anything you can share helps me get back to you with something useful instead of a generic reply.</p>

			<form class="intake-card" id="intake-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/mgojdjre" method="POST">

				<div class="form-section">
					<h3 class="form-section-title">About Your Organization</h3>

					<div class="field">
						<label for="name">Name</label>
						<input type="text" id="name" name="name" required />
					</div>
					<div class="field">
						<label for="team">Organization / Team Name</label>
						<input type="text" id="team" name="team" required />
					</div>
					<div class="field">
						<label for="email">Email Address</label>
						<input type="email" id="email" name="email" required />
					</div>
					<div class="field">
						<label for="website">Website or Social Links <span class="optional">(optional)</span></label>
						<input type="text" id="website" name="website" />
					</div>
					<div class="field">
						<label>What type of organization are you?</label>
						<div class="radio-group">
							<label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="org_type" value="School" required /> School</label>
							<label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="org_type" value="Sports Team" /> Sports Team</label>
							<label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="org_type" value="League" /> League</label>
							<label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="org_type" value="Club" /> Club</label>
							<label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="org_type" value="Other" /> Other</label>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<hr class="form-divider" />

				<div class="form-section">
					<h3 class="form-section-title">Your Identity</h3>

					<div class="field">
						<label>What best describes where you are today?</label>
						<div class="radio-group stacked">
							<label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="stage" value="Creating a new identity from the ground up" required /> We are creating a new identity from the ground up</label>
							<label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="stage" value="Refreshing an existing identity" /> We have an existing identity that needs a refresh</label>
							<label class="radio-option"><input type="radio" name="stage" value="Expanding our current brand presence" /> We want to expand and improve our current brand presence</label>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="field">
						<label for="why_now">What's prompting you to look at this now?</label>
						<textarea id="why_now" name="why_now"></textarea>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- Honeypot: hidden from humans, catches bots -->
				<input type="text" name="_gotcha" class="hp" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" />

				<div class="submit-row">
					<button type="submit" class="submit-btn">
						Send it
						<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
					</button>
					<p class="submit-note">Or just email <a href="mailto:hello@islandtwigstudios.com">hello@islandtwigstudios.com</a> directly.</p>
				</div>

				<div id="form-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

			</form>
		</section>
	</div>
	</section>

	<script>
		(function () {
			const form = document.getElementById('intake-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
			const status = document.getElementById('form-status');
			if (!form || !status) return;

			form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
				e.preventDefault();
				const btn = form.querySelector('.submit-btn') as HTMLButtonElement;
				const originalBtnHTML = btn.innerHTML;
				btn.disabled = true;
				btn.style.opacity = '0.6';
				btn.textContent = 'Sending...';

				const data = new FormData(form);
				fetch(form.action, {
					method: 'POST',
					body: data,
					headers: { Accept: 'application/json' },
				})
					.then(function (response) {
						if (response.ok) {
							form.reset();
							status.className = 'form-status success show';
							status.textContent = "Thanks, your message is on its way. I'll get back to you within a day.";
							btn.innerHTML = originalBtnHTML;
							btn.disabled = false;
							btn.style.opacity = '1';
						} else {
							response.json().then(function (d) {
								let msg = 'Something went wrong. Please email hello@islandtwigstudios.com directly.';
								if (d && d.errors && d.errors.length) {
									msg = d.errors.map((er: { message: string }) => er.message).join(', ');
								}
								status.className = 'form-status error show';
								status.textContent = msg;
								btn.innerHTML = originalBtnHTML;
								btn.disabled = false;
								btn.style.opacity = '1';
							});
						}
					})
					.catch(function () {
						status.className = 'form-status error show';
						status.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please email hello@islandtwigstudios.com directly.';
						btn.innerHTML = originalBtnHTML;
						btn.disabled = false;
						btn.style.opacity = '1';
					});
			});
		})();
	</script>
</Layout>

<style>
	.content {
		max-width: 1200px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 48px;
	}

	/* ═══ HEADER ═══ */

	.header {
		margin-bottom: 48px;
		padding-top: 56px;
	}

	/* Full-bleed bands, matching the homepage's banding. Scoped
	   custom-property overrides on the light bands mean every
	   existing rule below (already written against these tokens)
	   resolves to light-band-appropriate colors without its own
	   edit. */
	.services-band-light {
		background: var(--surface-cream);
		padding: 56px 0 64px;
		--text-strong: #1a1c1a;
		--text: #1a1c1a;
		--text-dim: #5a5f5a;
		--text-faint: rgba(42, 46, 40, 0.05);
		--border: var(--border-on-light);
		--surface: var(--surface-card);
		--surface-raised: #ffffff;
	}

	.services-band-dark { padding: 64px 0; }

	.services-band-soft {
		background: var(--surface-soft);
		padding: 64px 0;
		--text-strong: #1a1c1a;
		--text: #1a1c1a;
		--text-dim: #5a5f5a;
		--text-faint: rgba(42, 46, 40, 0.05);
		--border: var(--border-on-light);
		--surface: var(--surface-card);
		--surface-raised: #ffffff;
	}


	/* .eyebrow is defined in global.css (shared pill, every page). */

	.header h1 {
		font-size: var(--fs-h1);
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-strong);
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		line-height: 1.15;
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}

	.header p:not(.eyebrow) {
		font-size: var(--fs-body);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.availability {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
		margin-top: 18px;
		font-size: var(--fs-caption);
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
	}

	.availability::before {
		content: '';
		width: 7px;
		height: 7px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--accent);
		box-shadow: 0 0 8px color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 60%, transparent);
	}

	/* ═══ TIERS ═══ */

	.tiers {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 14px;
		margin-bottom: 14px;
	}

	.tier {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
	}

	/* Tier example image band — sits flush at the top, fills full card width.
	   Image defines its own height so there's no empty space on any edge. */
	.tier-image {
		width: 100%;
		flex-shrink: 0;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: var(--surface-raised);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
		line-height: 0;
	}

	.tier-image img {
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
		display: block;
		transition: transform 0.5s ease;
	}

	.tier:hover .tier-image img { transform: scale(1.03); }

	.tier::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		opacity: 0;
		transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
	}

	.tier:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
	.tier:hover {
		border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-warm) 15%, transparent);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
		box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
	}

	.tier.t-logo::before     { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 30% 10%, var(--accent-dim), transparent 60%); }
	.tier.t-system::before   { background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 10%, var(--accent-warm-dim), transparent 60%); }

	.tier-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; height: 100%; padding: 28px 26px; }

	/* Two-card variant for "Other Ways to Work Together": these
	   two are meant to feel complementary, not part of a pricing
	   ladder, so no third column and no "recommended" badge. */
	.tiers-two { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }

	.tier-recommended {
		position: absolute;
		top: 14px;
		right: 14px;
		font-size: var(--fs-micro);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--accent-warm);
		background: rgba(17, 17, 16, 0.82);
		backdrop-filter: blur(6px);
		border: 1px solid rgba(184, 137, 106, 0.3);
		padding: 4px 10px;
		border-radius: 100px;
		z-index: 3;
	}

	.tier-name {
		font-size: var(--fs-h3);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--text-strong);
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		margin-bottom: 4px;
	}

	.tier-clarifier {
		font-size: var(--fs-caption);
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin-bottom: 14px;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	/* Display price figure, not body text: doesn't belong in the
	   shared type scale, same reasoning as the monospace numerals
	   elsewhere on the site. */
	.tier-price {
		font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
		font-size: 32px;
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-strong);
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		margin-bottom: 6px;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.tier-timeline {
		font-size: var(--fs-label);
		font-weight: 500;
		color: var(--accent);
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		margin-bottom: 14px;
	}

	.tier-desc {
		font-size: var(--fs-small);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		line-height: 1.65;
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}

	.tier-includes {
		font-size: var(--fs-micro);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.12em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		margin-bottom: 10px;
		margin-top: auto;
	}

	.tier ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.tier li {
		font-size: var(--fs-small);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--text);
		padding-left: 18px;
		position: relative;
		margin-bottom: 8px;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.tier li::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		left: 0;
		top: 9px;
		width: 6px;
		height: 6px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--accent);
		opacity: 0.5;
	}

	.tier li:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }

	/* ═══ CUSTOM TIER ═══ */

	.custom-tier {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		padding: 24px 28px;
		margin-bottom: 56px;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: all 0.3s ease;
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.custom-tier::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 90% 50%, var(--accent-warm-dim), transparent 60%);
		opacity: 0;
		transition: opacity 0.4s ease;
	}

	.custom-tier:hover::before { opacity: 1; }
	.custom-tier:hover { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-warm) 15%, transparent); }

	.custom-tier-inner {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		width: 100%;
	}

	.custom-tier h3 {
		font-size: var(--fs-h4);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--text-strong);
		margin-bottom: 4px;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
	}

	.custom-tier p {
		font-size: var(--fs-small);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.arrow-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 6px;
		font-size: var(--fs-small);
		font-weight: 500;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: gap 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease;
		color: var(--accent-warm);
		white-space: nowrap;
		flex-shrink: 0;
	}

	.arrow-link svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; }
	.arrow-link:hover { gap: 10px; color: var(--text-strong); }

	/* ═══ SIGNATURE OFFER ═══
	   The Legacy to New Era System is the flagship service and
	   should visually dominate the page: a larger heading scale,
	   a two-column hero-style layout, and its own CTA, distinct
	   from the two smaller supporting-service cards below it. */

	.signature-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
		gap: 48px;
		align-items: center;
		margin-bottom: 56px;
	}

	.signature-text h2 {
		font-size: var(--fs-h1);
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--text-strong);
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		line-height: 1.1;
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}

	.signature-tagline {
		font-size: var(--fs-lead);
		font-weight: 600;
		color: var(--accent-warm);
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}

	.signature-desc {
		font-size: var(--fs-body-lg);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		line-height: 1.7;
		margin-bottom: 28px;
		max-width: 520px;
	}

	.signature-actions {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 22px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	.btn-signature {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 14px 26px;
		border-radius: 100px;
		background: var(--accent-warm);
		color: var(--btn-primary-text);
		font-size: var(--fs-small);
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: all 0.25s ease;
	}
	.btn-signature:hover { background: var(--accent-hover); transform: translateY(-1px); box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }

	.signature-image {
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		overflow: hidden;
		background: var(--surface-raised);
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
	}
	.signature-image img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }

	/* ═══ PROCESS ═══
	   Matches the homepage's process-band card treatment: cards
	   are always a lighter surface than their band, with a
	   Fira Code accent number, regardless of whether the band
